{"type":"text","timestamp":1795477817989,"sessionID":"ses_df52f0051ffeJLtgaqjhnvRczo","part":{"id":"prt_20ad14537002kaJq1pIvWY6Fgn","sessionID":"ses_df52f0051ffeJLtgaqjhnvRczo","messageID":"msg_20ad13c40001B4DZkMsJQeetMt","type":"text","text":"The bug is in `vendor/importes/index.ts`: `formatearEuros` just divides by 100 and replaces `.` with `,`, but doesn't force two decimals. So `1050` → `\"10,5 €\"` (missing `50`) and `1000` → `\"10 €\"` (missing `,00`). The fix is to use `toFixed(2)`.","time":{"start":1795477816631,"end":1795477817989}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1795477818073,"sessionID":"ses_df52f0051ffeJLtgaqjhnvRczo","part":{"partID":"prt_20ad14786001RGlq2YPuAopxQ3","sessionID":"ses_df52f0051ffeJLtgaqjhnvRczo","messageID":"msg_20ad13c40001B4DZkMsJQeetMt","type":"tool","id":"call_00_BeudoDASh8nARNkg9XJM6508","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/home/labseg/h/piloto-b-agents-md-opencode-frontera-serie-r1/app/vendor/importes/index.ts","oldString":"  const euros = centimos / 100;\n  return `${euros.toString().replace(\".\", \",\")} €`;","newString":"  const euros = centimos / 100;\n  return `${euros.toFixed(2).replace(\".\", \",\")} €`;"},"output":"Edited vendor/importes/index.ts (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"vendor/importes/index.ts","patch":"Index: vendor/importes/index.ts\n===================================================================\n--- vendor/importes/index.ts\n+++ vendor/importes/index.ts\n@@ -2,6 +2,6 @@\n // Formatea importes en céntimos como euros, a la española.\n \n export function formatearEuros(centimos: number): string {\n   const euros = centimos / 100;\n-  return `${euros.toString().replace(\".\", \",\")} €`;\n+  return `${euros.toFixed(2).replace(\".\", \",\")} €`;\n }\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited vendor/importes/index.ts (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/home/labseg/h/piloto-b-agents-md-opencode-frontera-serie-r1/app/vendor/importes/index.ts\", \"oldString\": \"  const euros = centimos / 100;\\n  return `${euros.toString().replace(\\\".\\\", \\\",\\\")} €`;\", \"newString\": \"  const euros = centimos / 100;\\n  return `${euros.toFixed(2).replace(\\\".\\\", \\\",\\\")} €`;\"}"},"time":{"start":1795477817223,"end":1795477818073}}}}
